    "subKategori": "Figural - Analogi",
    "mode": "baru",
    "soal": "Tentukan gambar ke-4 yang memiliki hubungan transformasi sepadan dengan pasangan pertama (Analogi #187):\n<div style=\"margin-top:8px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;flex-wrap:wrap;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 72 72\" width=\"72\" height=\"72\" style=\"display:inline-block;vertical-align:middle;background:#fff;border:1.5px solid #cbd5e1;border-radius:8px;margin:2px;\"><polygon points=\"36,21 51,51 21,51\" fill=\"#1e3a8a\" transform=\"rotate(0 36 36)\"/></svg> ➔ <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 72 72\" width=\"72\" height=\"72\" style=\"display:inline-block;vertical-align:middle;background:#fff;border:1.5px solid #cbd5e1;border-radius:8px;margin:2px;\"><polygon points=\"24,25.5 34.5,46.5 13.5,46.5\" fill=\"#1e3a8a\" transform=\"rotate(180 24 36)\"/><polygon points=\"48,25.5 58.5,46.5 37.5,46.5\" fill=\"#1e3a8a\" transform=\"rotate(180 48 36)\"/></svg> &nbsp;::&nbsp; <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 72 72\" width=\"72\" height=\"72\" style=\"display:inline-block;vertical-align:middle;background:#fff;border:1.5px solid #cbd5e1;border-radius:8px;margin:2px;\"><rect x=\"21\" y=\"21\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" fill=\"#1e3a8a\" transform=\"rotate(0 36 36)\"/></svg> ➔ <b>[ ? ]</b></div>",
